    {
      "id": "1.25.10",
      "label": "1.25.10",
      "numbers": [
        10
      ],
      "devanagari": "सुन्दे तु निहते राम सागस्त्यमृषिसत्तमम् |\nताटका सह पुत्रेण प्रधर्षयितुमिच्छति",
      "iast": "sunde tu nihate rāma sā agastyam ṛṣi sattamam |\ntāṭakā saha putreṇa pradharṣayitum icchati",
      "translation": "\"But when Sunda is eliminated by sage Agastya's curse, she that Tataka wished to retaliate that eminent sage along with her son Mareecha.",
