      "label": "1.25.11",
      "numbers": [
        11
      ],
      "devanagari": "भक्षार्थं जातसंरम्भा गर्जन्ती साभ्यधावत |\nआपतन्तीं तु तां दृष्ट्वा अगस्त्यो भगवानृषिः\nराक्षसत्वं भजस्वेति मारीचं व्याजहार सः |",
      "iast": "bhakśārtham jāta saṃrambhā garjantI sā abhyadhāvata |\nāpatantIm tu tām dṛṣṭvā agastyo bhagavān ṛṣiḥ\nrākṣasatvam bhajasva iti mārīcam vyājahāra saḥ |",
      "translation": "\"With desperation brewing in her she roaringly rushed towards the sage as though to eat him away, and on seeing her rushing along with her son Mareecha towards him, the godly saint Agastya firstly cursed Mareecha saying, 'you will attain demon-hood.'",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "saa garjantiii",
          "iast": "sā garjantīi",
