    {
      "id": "1.25.12",
      "label": "1.25.12, 13",
      "numbers": [
        12,
        13
      ],
      "devanagari": "अगस्त्यः परमामर्षस्ताटकामपि शप्तवान्\nपुरुषादी महायक्षी विरूपा विकृतानना |\nइदं रूपं विहायाशु दारुणं रूपमस्तु ते",
      "iast": "agastyaḥ parama amarṣaḥ tāṭakām api śaptavān\npuruṣādī mahāyakṣī virūpā vikṛta ānanā |\nidam rūpam vihāyāśu dāruṇam rūpam astu te",
      "translation": "\"Highly infuriated sage Agastya even cursed Tataka saying, 'forthwith divested of this form of a beautiful female, oh, great yakshii, you shall become a man eater with your form distorted, face contorted, and shape monstrous.'",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
