          "iast": "te dāruṇam rūpam astu",
          "devanagari": "ते दारुणं रूपं अस्तु",
          "meaning": "to you, monstrous, form, shall be.",
          "anvayaIndex": 7,
          "verseIndex": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.25.14",
      "label": "1.25.14",
      "numbers": [
        14
      ],
      "devanagari": "सैषा शापकृतामर्षा ताटका क्रोधमूर्च्छिता |\nदेशमुत्सादयत्येनमगस्त्याचरितं शुभम्",
      "iast": "saiṣā śāpa kṛtām arṣā tāṭakā krodha mūrchitā |\ndeśam utsādayati enam agastyā caritam śubham",
      "translation": "\"Frenzied by the curse and convulsed in fury she that Tataka is thus vandalising this auspicious province, in which sage Agastya once sauntered.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
