          "devanagari": "उत्सादयति",
          "meaning": "is vandalizing.",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.25.15",
      "label": "1.25.15",
      "numbers": [
        15
      ],
      "devanagari": "एनां राघवदुर्वृत्तां यक्षीं परमदारुणाम् |\nगोब्राह्मणहितार्थाय जहि दुष्टपराक्रमाम्",
      "iast": "enām rāghava durvṛttām yakṣīm parama dāruṇām |\ngo brāhmaṇa hitārthāya jahi duṣṭa parākramām",
      "translation": "\"She that highly atrocious one is with horrific behaviour and malefic valour, hence you shall eliminate this yakshii for the welfare of Brahmans and cows.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "dur vR^ittaam",
