          "meaning": "this, yakshii be",
          "anvayaIndex": 3,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "itrans": "go braahmaNa hita arthaaya",
          "iast": "go brāhmaṇa hita arthāya",
          "devanagari": "गो ब्राह्मण हित अर्थाय",
          "meaning": "cows, Brahmins, for welfare of",
