    {
      "id": "1.25.16",
      "label": "1.25.16",
      "numbers": [
        16
      ],
      "devanagari": "न ह्येनां शापसंसृष्टां कश्चिदुत्सहते पुमान् |\nनिहन्तुं त्रिषु लोकेषु त्वामृते रघुनन्दन",
      "iast": "na hi enām śāpa saṃsṛṣṭām kaścit utsahate pumān |\nnihantum triṣu lokeṣu tvām ṛte raghu nandana",
      "translation": "\"Excepting you there is none to eliminate her who is indomitably sheathed in a curse, oh, Raghu's legatee, and none in the three worlds can possibly brave her.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "raghu nandana",
