          "anvayaIndex": 6,
          "verseIndex": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.25.17",
      "label": "1.25.17",
      "numbers": [
        17
      ],
      "devanagari": "न हि ते स्त्रीवधकृते घृणा कार्या नरोत्तम |\nचातुर्वर्ण्यहितार्थाय कर्तव्यम् राजसूनुना",
      "iast": "na hi te strī vadha kṛte ghṛṇā kāryā narottama |\ncātur varṇya hitārthām hi kartavyam rāja sūnunā",
      "translation": "\"Compassion regarding the elimination of a female is ungermane, oh, best one among men, since a prince has to effectuate it intending the welfare of four categories of society.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "nara uttama",
          "iast": "nara uttama",
          "devanagari": "नर उत्तम",
          "meaning": "among men, the best, Rama",
