          "iast": "cātur varṇya hita arartham",
          "devanagari": "चातुर् वर्ण्य हित अरर्थं",
          "meaning": "four, caste-system, welfare, intending",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": null
        },
        {
