          "iast": "sa doṣam vā",
          "devanagari": "स दोषं वा",
          "meaning": "with, vilification, or",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 8
        },
        {
          "itrans": "sadaa kartavyam",
          "iast": "sadā kartavyam",
          "devanagari": "सदा कर्तव्यं",
          "meaning": "always, is to be done.",
          "anvayaIndex": 6,
          "verseIndex": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.25.19",
      "label": "1.25.19",
      "numbers": [
        19
      ],
      "devanagari": "राज्यभारनियुक्तानामेष धर्मः सनातनः |\nअधर्म्यां जहि काकुत्स्थ धर्मो ह्यस्यां न विद्यते",
      "iast": "rājya bhāra niyuk{}tānām eṣa dharmaḥ sanātanaḥ |\nadharṃyām jahi kākutstha dharmo hi asyām na vidyate",
      "translation": "\"To the nominee who bears the burden of kingdom this is the age-old duty, and hence oh, Rama, the legatee of Kakutstha, eliminate this infamy, as goodness is inevident in her, isn't it.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
